    {
      "id": "claim_02ac725d6c4848ffaebd953b0daa2076",
      "statement": "sort_system picks exactly one branch: 1G1R or hybrid when a console system has REGIONS_ONE, else regions mode when it has REGIONS_ALL, else arcade set-type sorting when an arcade system has an arcade list, else every game that survives the discard filter stays in the system directory.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/sort_roms.rs#L206-L652",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:24f05f8f5b5bbbad4e723c0298260df436e03e0326a7779280b4afc80bdfa95b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dd4b7bdebf074f308f1bf8d7b20cdfb8",
      "statement": "In 1G1R mode each Parent-Clone group is weight-sorted, filtered, and then, for each REGIONS_ONE region in order, the first game whose regions contain it is elected to 1G1R if it is complete, strict mode is on, or no game of the group is complete; the remaining games go to the system directory when a region matches REGIONS_ALL — with ZZ (Region::Unknown) acting as a catch-all — and to Trash otherwise.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/sort_roms.rs#L254-L339",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8e5c8ccdcd484430afeb8555aab84136e50bf5f062d8edff304aa2966d97d5ba:"
        },
